# basePath Chapter3

:: FirstContractOpenCh3
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once

{@PAL}      Okey-dokey Captain. 
{@PAL}      Now, you're going to be working with Diodes! 
{@Player}   ...
{@PAL}      Now, diodes can enforce unidirectional current flow and they-
{@Player}   ... 
{@PAL}      Uh... Captain? 
{@Player}   Huh? 
{@PAL}      I'm talking about the diodes capacity to attenuate high signals and you seem...
{@PAL}      Unenthused. 
{@Player}   Sorry, P.A.L., my mind was somewhere else. 
{@PAL}      Perhaps, it has something to do with your call with your former crew-mate?
{@Player}   Doesn't matter, let's just do the contract. 
{@PAL}      Sounds good Captain! 

//endregion

::AfterResearchCh3
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene
@once 


::AfterDesignCh3
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene
@once


//endregion 

::BeforeSupplyChainCh3
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

//introduced idea of cost vs time

{@PAL}      Hey Captain, you have a new supplier who is selling gold which would work as a conductor. 
{@Player} 	Ummm... gold? Isn't that really expensive? 
{@PAL} 		Sure it is but when you calculate travel time and cost of transport, sometimes the extra money is worth it. 
{@Player}	Alright, let's give him a call. 
//call Xavier
{@Xavier}   ... 
{@Xavier}   Hello. 
{@Player}   So... are you the supplier or-- 
{@Xavier}	I'm Xavier. Supplier contact for the Ralston sector.
{@Xavier}   Planet of Gold and Golden Opportunities. 
{@Xavier}   Any and all materials within this sector goes through me. Capiche? 
{@Xavier}	And who are you? 
{@Player}	I'm the Captain of the Constantine. I'm running a fab here and need some materials.
{@Xavier}   Well now. Let's talk business. You need material. I have it. You let me know what you want, it's done. 
{@Player}   Uh... well... I'll let you know. Gold seems kinda pricey...
{@Xavier}   Hmph. Fine. Call me back when you are ready for the good stuff. 



::AfterFabrication
@trigger 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene
@once 

{@PAL}      Looks like this contract was a piece of cake!
{@Player} 	You don’t even know what cake tastes like. 
{@PAL} 	    According to my human empathy algorithm cake tastes…
{@PAL}      10011000  10101000 10110000 !
{@Player} 	…right. 	


